From a1f6792c3617e345c102bcbec1eb98697d28813a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dev <dev@example.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 05:31:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: optional extra charge per room, added to monthly bills

- Room: extraChargeLabel / extraChargeAmount (optional; 0 clears it)
- UtilityBill snapshots the charge and includes it in totalAmount
- V9 migration adds the columns to rooms and utility_bills
- Room form, bill preview, single and bulk receipts show the charge
- Controller tests for room charge applied, zero override, negative rejected
